      "title": "Name the change",
      "text": "At checkout, some people give up when they reach payment. You want fewer people to give up there: that’s a **UX goal**, the change in their experience. A UX goal names a change in people’s experience, not a design the team might add. _Add a progress bar_ is a possible design, not the goal.",
